 training and engaging. This app has something for all skill levels.\n\nThis was the first VR app delivered to the pickleball community. ", "short_description": "Enter a pickleball vision training app! Developed by a group of vision experts to train eye-hand coordination, reaction time, and improve on-court decision making. \n\nThis is not a pickleball match simulation.  It houses strategic drills to support your progression in the sport.\n\nThe app contains 6 keys drills that prove to be powerful for training and engaging. This app has something for all skill levels."}]}, "developer_name": "Pickle Docs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrpickle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CVC Game Dev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://VRPickle.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6899427870110070"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_1306608436485171_8926125106184030615_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2wxpplqyrRkQ7kNvwHXaRPo&_nc_oc=AdosmYHbUKl6f1VMZ377h50FweTPN5qetx725AQfkENz84Q5GJAdBFSs65PCskQK2xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ98KYK_iDWJJ1HsoZFw4C-Wu